(\"LED\"), nicht Pin(25)","en":"Uses Pin(\"LED\"), not Pin(25)","es":"Usa Pin(\"LED\"), no Pin(25)","fr":"Utilise Pin(\"LED\"), pas Pin(25)","hi":"Pin(\"LED\") इस्तेमाल करता है, Pin(25) नहीं","zh":"使用 Pin(\"LED\")，而不是 Pin(25)"},"must":["Pin(\"LED\""],"mustNot":["Pin(25"],"visibility":"visible"}],"id":"main","name":{"de":"Die LED blinken lassen","en":"Blink the LED","es":"Haz parpadear el LED","fr":"Faire clignoter la LED","hi":"LED ब्लिंक करें","zh":"让 LED 闪烁"},"runMs":4000}],"views":[{"id":"vw_bb","kind":"breadboard","name":"Breadboard","placements":[{"c":"brd_main","x_mm":-90,"y_mm":0},{"c":"cmp_bb","x_mm":0,"y_mm":0},{"c":"cmp_led1","legs":{"A":"c14","K":"c15"},"x_mm":0,"y_mm":0},{"c":"cmp_r1","legs":{"P1":"b10","P2":"b14"},"x_mm":0,"y_mm":0}],"surface":"cmp_bb","wires":[{"color":"orange","from":{"c":"brd_main","kind":"pin","p":"GP15"},"id":"wir_1","net":"net_gp15","to":{"hole":"a10","kind":"hole","surface":"cmp_bb"}},{"color":"black","from":{"c":"brd_main","kind":"pin","p":"GND"},"id":"wir_2","net":"net_gnd","to":{"hole":"a15","kind":"hole","surface":"cmp_bb"}}]}]}
